<title>UK: London gold fixes at 11-1/2 year low, nervous.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes at 11-1/2 year low, nervous.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $325.20 vs $332.55 previously, lowest fix since January 1986. Heavy long liquidation in Asia follow U.S. fund selling. Europe relatively quiet. Price may consolidate given U.S. holiday.</p>
<p>SILVER - Also sharply lower at $4.55/$4.57 down nine cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Down about $5.00 at $418.00/$420.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Off $1.50 at $188.00/$192.00.</p>
</text>
